---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE, ELSEWHERE } from "../site";
---

<Base title="The other stuff">
  <h1>The other stuff</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Work matters a lot to me.</p>
    <p>
      I like making money. I like building things. I like being useful. I like
      winning.
    </p>
    <p>But I’m learning that a good life has to be bigger than work.</p>
    <p>
      I want good relationships. I want to be around people I love. I want to
      travel. I want to stay healthy. I want to experience things. I want to
      have enough money that I’m not constantly worried about money.
    </p>
    <p>And I want to have some fun.</p>
    <p>
      I’m ambitious, but I don’t want to spend my whole life being busy just
      because I know how to be busy.
    </p>
    <p>That’s probably the thing I’m still working on.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="label">if you want to talk</p>
  <p>
    If you’re building something, running an agency, trying to grow a business,
    or just want to grab a coffee and talk about what’s going on:{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} data-track="email click">{SITE.email}</a>
  </p>
  <p>I read everything.</p>

  <p class="label">find me</p>
  <ul class="rows">
    {ELSEWHERE.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a><span class="meta">↗</span></li>)}
  </ul>
</Base>
